OL,3,CApprentice Boys parade taking place in
OL,4,CLondonderry
OL,6,FCrowds have turned out for the annual
OL,7,FApprentice Boys parade in Londonderry.
OL,9,FThousands of Apprentice Boys members
OL,10,Fand marching bands are marking the
OL,11,F337th anniversary of the Relief of
OL,12,FDerry on Saturday.
OL,14,FA service of thanksgiving in St
OL,15,FColumb's Cathedral is taking place.
OL,17,FThe PSNI said traffic diversions and
OL,18,Fdelays are likely ahead of the main
OL,19,Fparade at 12.30pm.
