OL,3,CApprentice Boys parade taking place in
OL,4,CLondonderry
OL,6,FThe event commemorates the end of the
OL,7,F105-day siege of Derry in 1689.
OL,9,FIt began after the forces of the
OL,10,FCatholic King James II approached the
OL,11,Fcity, and were foiled by 13
OL,12,Fapprentices who locked the city gates
OL,13,Fagainst them.
